 nuna, bujo) must not be identity maps (they must move at least one slot).\n\nThe end-to-end behavior is that n1 (SIDA's only slot) goes through all steps and ends up at s1 (NIDO's only slot). So, the composition of all operations must map", "class": "INVALID", "logprobs": {"sum_logprob": -2325.3216310614357, "n_tokens": 12000}, "answer_chars": 33567}
